      "text": "7. B: Nǐ yào zuò shénme shíhoude     What train do you want to take?\n      chē?\n   A: Wǒ yào zuò shàngwǔde chē.      I want to take a morning train.\n\nNote on No. 7\n\nShénme shíhoude chē has been translated simply as \"what train.\" More literally, the phrase means \"a train (arriving at) what time.\"\n"
